stemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯入局Personal Agent赛道，代号Handy Bot的个人智能体已在微信低调内测</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">特斯拉获300亿美元新增信贷额度，加速Cybercab与Optimus量产</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布自主智能体Dots并上线企业应用市场，ChatGPT转型软件分发平台</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌正式停用安卓端Google Assistant，全面由Gemini接管手机语音入口</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌已正式在安卓手机端停用Google Assistant，全面由Gemini接管语音交互入口。用户反馈显示，Gemini应用账户菜单中切换回Google Assistant的选项已被移除，标志着旧版助手在移动端的彻底退场。此次变动覆盖范围包括手机、智能手表、Android Auto车机及耳机等移动设备与配件。不过，谷歌明确智能音箱与智能显示器将继续支持Google Assistant。尽管Gemini具备更强的AI处理能力，但部分用户指出其在离线语音指令响应及稳定性方面仍存在不足，相比旧版助手在特定场景下表现欠佳。谷歌此举旨在通过Gemini统一移动端AI入口，以实现更深度的模型集成，但这一过渡期在功能适配与用户习惯磨合上仍面临挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌向免费用户开放Gemini Skills服务，Gems功能将于11月完成整合</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1852f2441e292b932389d773dde75c97.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式向所有免费账户用户开放Gemini Skills自定义指令服务，此前该功能仅限于Pro和Ultra付费订阅等级。按照官方规划，原有的Gems功能将于2026年11月17日自动过渡并整合至Skills系统中。升级后的Skills优化了操作逻辑，用户仅需在Gemini聊天框输入斜杠“/”及指令即可快速唤醒特定技能，替代了此前Gems在列表中滚动查找的低效交互。此次调整确保了免费用户不仅能保留现有自定义配置，还可通过专属链接创建新Skills。通过降低个性化AI工具的使用门槛，谷歌旨在提升Gemini在大众市场的用户粘性，并有效缓解用户向Perplexity Projects等竞品流失的风险，进一步推动AI助手在日常场景的深化应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯入局Personal Agent赛道，代号Handy Bot的个人智能体已在微信低调内测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9dbda58b580eb11e1a27f620119fa313.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯正秘密开发代号为&quot;Handy Bot&quot;的Personal Agent产品，目前已在微信端以服务号形式开启低调内测。该产品定位为个人智能体，与传统Chatbot的一问一答模式不同，Handy Bot旨在实现“常驻后台”功能，用户仅需设定宏观目标，AI即可在云端持续推进任务，无需人类逐条指令干预。其核心逻辑对标Meta的Muse，通过云端处理比价购物、邮件处理及行程盯守等生活琐事。目前该项目处于内部测试阶段，未来计划推出独立App。在个人智能体赛道，阿里正推动千问向具备上下文记忆的“我的千问”演进，字节跳动也在研发代号“Spell”的个人助理。行业认为，该类产品的落地关键在于平衡模型任务规划能力、生态工具开放度以及合规隐私边界。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">特斯拉获300亿美元新增信贷额度，加速Cybercab与Optimus量产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0b05623cc8b98f58a8a45098b8aca1ef.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">特斯拉已敲定总额300亿美元的新增信贷额度，旨在全面支持Cybercab无人驾驶出租车、Optimus人形机器人及Tesla Semi卡车的规模化研发与量产建设。该信贷由多家金融机构承接，包括花旗银行提供的200亿美元三年期延期提取定期贷款，以及富国银行牵头的80亿美元五年期和20亿美元一年期循环信贷协议。特斯拉在监管文件中表示，今年内暂无动用计划。截至2026年第二季度末，公司现金及投资储备超400亿美元，负债约90亿美元，预计全年资本支出至少达250亿美元。目前，Semi与Optimus正采取建设专用独立工厂的重资产路径，这笔巨额流动性储备将为端到端自动驾驶与具身智能产品的产能爬坡提供关键的抗风险缓冲，标志着特斯拉从算法验证正式迈向工业级硬件制造的规模化扩张阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布自主智能体Dots并上线企业应用市场，ChatGPT转型软件分发平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c7eab8cf1a7b9a8765f273deeaef28ea.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI在开发者日推出自主AI智能体Dots及企业应用市场，将ChatGPT重塑为集软件发现、调用与运行于一体的综合分发平台。Dots智能体配备专属云端计算机与浏览器，打通逾4000个应用生态，支持在只读模式下执行建站、排会及Bug修复等复杂任务，实现意图驱动的交互。ChatGPT现支持内嵌Figma、Adobe等第三方应用交互面板，并推出“使用ChatGPT登录”系统，首批接入Devin、Notion、Vercel等16家平台。企业应用市场已汇聚Salesforce、HubSpot等30余家合作伙伴，支持使用OpenAI额度抵扣软件费用。此次升级通过统一身份层与重构软件发现机制，实质性搭建起绕开传统应用商店的AI原生分发网络，标志着软件交互范式从图形界面主导向大模型底座驱动的深度演进。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
